      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 70,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "A longer life",
        "for your thinking."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-159df2dba4b9",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "our-story-en-1440.016",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 16,
      "x": 76,
      "y": 384,
      "width": 532,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 27.55,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA begins with a simple gap: we say more to AI, but it",
        "can still be difficult to return to our own words."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-1db97a7b9d37",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
