      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 52,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "An intention,",
        "not an inflated promise."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-d6fd07b85332",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "our-story-en-1440.031",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 31,
      "x": 76,
      "y": 2014,
      "width": 492,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 24.65,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA is independently developed and in private beta. Some",
        "ambitions are further away than the current build. We",
        "separate what is available, what remains under development",
        "and what still needs real-world evidence."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-bfbb59e8409e",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
